        "category": "bug",
        "title": "Option<P> Scene doesn't forward register_dependencies",
        "explanation": "The impl only overrides resolve. register_dependencies falls back to the trait default, which is a no-op because TemplatePatch also omits it. A Some(inner) scene with asset dependencies, such as an inherited scene, will therefore not register them. Waiting for dependencies won't happen, and resolve can fail with MissingSceneDependency.",
        "suggestion": "Add `fn register_dependencies(&self, dependencies: &mut SceneDependencies) { if let Some(s) = self { s.register_dependencies(dependencies); } }`.",
        "evidence": "impl<P> Scene for Option<P>",
